# PodMotion CODEOWNERS
# Every path is owned by the maintainers team by default.
# Security-sensitive paths additionally require a security reviewer.
# Order matters: the last matching pattern wins — default is listed first.

*                           @podmotion-io/maintainers

# Security-sensitive paths — require maintainer + security reviewer.
/bpf/                       @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers
/internal/agent/            @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers
/pkg/nri/                   @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers
/pkg/restore/               @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers
/docs/legal/                @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers

# Governance and security policy changes also require security reviewers.
/SECURITY.md                @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers
/GOVERNANCE.md              @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @podmotion-io/maintainers @podmotion-io/security-reviewers
